{"title": "Spooky Manor", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorMain.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorMain.jpg/320px-SpookyManorMain.jpg?1535e5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorMain.jpg/480px-SpookyManorMain.jpg?1535e5 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorMain.jpg/640px-SpookyManorMain.jpg?1535e5 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorMain.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Spooky Manor.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Spooky Manor</b>, also referred to as the Dilapidated Manor, is a variation of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Interiors#The_Mansion\">Mansion</a> interior. It is similar in gameplay but is structurally distinct, has extra tiles, and has dramatically altered visuals to make it look older and more decrepit. It most commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Crowd\" title=\"Crowd\">Crowd</a> followed by <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\">Gloom</a>. The former generates a unique trial there instead of a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Interior_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Interior Features</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reveal_the_Key\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reveal the Key</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Prepare_for_Dinner\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Prepare for Dinner</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Pull_the_Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pull the Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Attic</b> - A small attic with several boxes and tools in it. A safe and painting are also here, which the safe requires a <b>Manor safe key</b> to open. A key is acquired after completing a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>.</li>\n<li><b>Dining Hall</b> - A large hall with a fireplace with tables and silverware set up for a meal. This area is mostly for the <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Prepare_for_Dinner\"><b>Prepare for Dinner</b></a> objective.</li>\n<li><b>Library</b> - A room with several bookshelves that is different from the larger room with a staircase and bookshelves. This area is mostly for the <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Pull_the_Books\"><b>Pull the Books</b></a> objective.</li>\n<li><b>Wine Cellar</b> - A narrow corridor that connects to a wine cellar.</li>\n<li><b>Empty Pool</b> - The pool room that normally has water and a pink inflatable in it can sometimes be empty.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Interior_Features\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Interior_Features\">&gt; Interior Features</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Moons tagged as <b>RegularManor</b> will switch to vanilla textures and visuals.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorAttic.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorAttic.jpg/320px-SpookyManorAttic.jpg?3bd4a7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorAttic.jpg/480px-SpookyManorAttic.jpg?3bd4a7 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorAttic.jpg/640px-SpookyManorAttic.jpg?3bd4a7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorAttic.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The painting and safe in the Attic.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that spawns in the safe located in the <b>Attic</b>.\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reveal_the_Key\">Reveal the Key</span></h3>\n<p>The painting next to the safe in the <b>Attic</b> will tell players to find them inside the interior. Players must find the room in the interior with a painting that has glowing eyes. Players must then find and interact with a key lodged into the wall or floor in that room.\n</p><p>Once players get the key, they can return to and open the safe in the <b>Attic</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Prepare_for_Dinner\">Prepare for Dinner</span></h3>\n<p>If the painting next to the safe in the <b>Attic</b> is brown, players can find a similar painting above the fire place in the <b>Dining Hall</b>. There will be a set of two switches on the walls in each corner of the room with a hint above them. Players must turn off or on each light above a seat depending on how many guests, indicated by the plate in front of a seat having food on it, are in the room following the instructions of a hint. The simplified version of the hints are as follows:\n</p>\n<ul><li>If there are zero, one, or two guests, players must turn off all the lights.</li>\n<li>If there are three or five guests, players must turn off the lights above the seat of each guest and turn on all other lights.</li>\n<li>If there are four or six guests, players must turn on the light above the seat of each guest and turn off all other lights.</li>\n<li>If there are seven or eight guests, players must turn on all the lights.</li></ul>\n<p>If successful, the fireplace will turn green and a key will be dropped out of it. Players can now return to the safe in the <b>Attic</b> and open it for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pull_the_Books\">Pull the Books</span></h3>\n<p>If the painting next to the safe in the <b>Attic</b> is of a clock with several books behind it, players can head to the <b>Library</b> and find a similar painting on the center pillar. Eight dark blue books with a yellow binding can be interacted with and moved on the bookshelves. Once a book is interacted with, a clock will start ticking and players must interact with all the books within about 35 seconds. Every book will reset after time is up.\n</p><p>If successful, the bookshelf behind the center pillar and painting will move and reveal the key. Players can now return to the safe in the <b>Attic</b> and open it for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Spooky Manor Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Solo Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Empty haunted relic</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Empty_haunted_relic.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Empty haunted relic.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Empty_haunted_relic.png/60px-Empty_haunted_relic.png?708759\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Empty_haunted_relic.png/90px-Empty_haunted_relic.png?708759 1.5x, /images/thumb/Empty_haunted_relic.png/120px-Empty_haunted_relic.png?708759 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>187</td>\n<td>183</td>\n<td>214\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Haunted relic</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Haunted_relic.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Haunted relic.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Haunted_relic.png/60px-Haunted_relic.png?c02963\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Haunted_relic.png/90px-Haunted_relic.png?c02963 1.5x, /images/thumb/Haunted_relic.png/120px-Haunted_relic.png?c02963 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>315</td>\n<td>310</td>\n<td>362\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Possessed haunted relic</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Possessed_haunted_relic.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Possessed haunted relic.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Possessed_haunted_relic.png/60px-Possessed_haunted_relic.png?e1c32d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Possessed_haunted_relic.png/90px-Possessed_haunted_relic.png?e1c32d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Possessed_haunted_relic.png/120px-Possessed_haunted_relic.png?e1c32d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>491</td>\n<td>482</td>\n<td>563\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. <b>Prepare for Dinner</b> is considered Easy difficulty and has a 1.0x multiplier. <b>Reveal the Key</b> and <b>Pull the Books</b> are both considered Medium difficulty and have a 1.15x multiplier. The base value and multipliers for objective rewards can be adjusted in the Wesleys Interior Tools config under the Secondary Objectives section.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Hallowed\" title=\"Weathers\"><b>Hallowed</b></a> weather used to cause candles, pumpkins, and skulls will decorate the interior. This does not currently seem to happen in the <b>Obscurity</b> update.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorBath.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A bathroom.\"><img alt=\"A bathroom.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorBath.jpg/120px-SpookyManorBath.jpg?39304c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorBath.jpg/180px-SpookyManorBath.jpg?39304c 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorBath.jpg/240px-SpookyManorBath.jpg?39304c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A bathroom.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorBed.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A bedroom.\"><img alt=\"A bedroom.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorBed.jpg/120px-SpookyManorBed.jpg?537209\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorBed.jpg/180px-SpookyManorBed.jpg?537209 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorBed.jpg/240px-SpookyManorBed.jpg?537209 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A bedroom.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorGarage.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A garage.\"><img alt=\"A garage.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorGarage.jpg/120px-SpookyManorGarage.jpg?4a0fed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorGarage.jpg/180px-SpookyManorGarage.jpg?4a0fed 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorGarage.jpg/240px-SpookyManorGarage.jpg?4a0fed 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A garage.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorCellar.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Wine Cellar.\"><img alt=\"The Wine Cellar.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorCellar.jpg/120px-SpookyManorCellar.jpg?58a04e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorCellar.jpg/180px-SpookyManorCellar.jpg?58a04e 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorCellar.jpg/240px-SpookyManorCellar.jpg?58a04e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Wine Cellar.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorLibrary.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Library.\"><img alt=\"The Library.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorLibrary.jpg/120px-SpookyManorLibrary.jpg?c15851\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorLibrary.jpg/180px-SpookyManorLibrary.jpg?c15851 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorLibrary.jpg/240px-SpookyManorLibrary.jpg?c15851 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Library.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Dining Hall.\"><img alt=\"The Dining Hall.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg/120px-SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg?ef1034\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg/180px-SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg?ef1034 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg/240px-SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg?ef1034 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Dining Hall.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorPool.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Empty Pool.\"><img alt=\"The Empty Pool.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorPool.jpg/120px-SpookyManorPool.jpg?1ceedb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorPool.jpg/180px-SpookyManorPool.jpg?1ceedb 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorPool.jpg/240px-SpookyManorPool.jpg?1ceedb 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Empty Pool.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorEyes.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The painting with eyes for the Reveal the Key objective.\"><img alt=\"The painting with eyes for the Reveal the Key objective.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorEyes.jpg/120px-SpookyManorEyes.jpg?20c7e7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorEyes.jpg/180px-SpookyManorEyes.jpg?20c7e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorEyes.jpg/240px-SpookyManorEyes.jpg?20c7e7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The painting with eyes for the Reveal the Key objective.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorKey.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The key prompting players to reveal it.\"><img alt=\"The key prompting players to reveal it.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorKey.jpg/120px-SpookyManorKey.jpg?30d1b0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorKey.jpg/180px-SpookyManorKey.jpg?30d1b0 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorKey.jpg/240px-SpookyManorKey.jpg?30d1b0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The key prompting players to reveal it.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorHint.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"One of the hints for the Prepare for Dinner objective, saying &quot;AN UNEVEN NUMBER. A LIGHT FOR THOSE WE AWAIT&quot;.\"><img alt=\"One of the hints for the Prepare for Dinner objective, saying &quot;AN UNEVEN NUMBER. A LIGHT FOR THOSE WE AWAIT&quot;.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorHint.jpg/120px-SpookyManorHint.jpg?c2853c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorHint.jpg/180px-SpookyManorHint.jpg?c2853c 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorHint.jpg/240px-SpookyManorHint.jpg?c2853c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">One of the hints for the Prepare for Dinner objective, saying \"AN UNEVEN NUMBER. A LIGHT FOR THOSE WE AWAIT\".</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MoveBook.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A book players can move for the Pull the Books objective.\"><img alt=\"A book players can move for the Pull the Books objective.\" src=\"/images/thumb/MoveBook.jpg/120px-MoveBook.jpg?727af3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/MoveBook.jpg/180px-MoveBook.jpg?727af3 1.5x, /images/thumb/MoveBook.jpg/240px-MoveBook.jpg?727af3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A book players can move for the Pull the Books objective.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BookKey.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The key spawning after pulling all the books.\"><img alt=\"The key spawning after pulling all the books.\" src=\"/images/thumb/BookKey.jpg/120px-BookKey.jpg?9d9a23\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/BookKey.jpg/180px-BookKey.jpg?9d9a23 1.5x, /images/thumb/BookKey.jpg/240px-BookKey.jpg?9d9a23 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The key spawning after pulling all the books.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpookyManorHallowed.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The main entrance with various decorations during Hallowed weather.\"><img alt=\"The main entrance with various decorations during Hallowed weather.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorHallowed.jpg/120px-SpookyManorHallowed.jpg?f26928\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpookyManorHallowed.jpg/180px-SpookyManorHallowed.jpg?f26928 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpookyManorHallowed.jpg/240px-SpookyManorHallowed.jpg?f26928 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The main entrance with various decorations during Hallowed weather.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["SpookyManorBath.jpg", "SpookyManorBed.jpg", "SpookyManorGarage.jpg", "SpookyManorCellar.jpg", "SpookyManorLibrary.jpg", "SpookyManorDiningHall.jpg", "SpookyManorPool.jpg", "SpookyManorEyes.jpg", "SpookyManorKey.jpg", "SpookyManorHint.jpg", "MoveBook.jpg", "BookKey.jpg", "SpookyManorHallowed.jpg", "SpookyManorMain.jpg", "SpookyManorAttic.jpg", "Empty_haunted_relic.png", "Haunted_relic.png", "Possessed_haunted_relic.png"], "cats": []}